<title>USA: LTC Properties ups qtly div to $0.365.</title>
<headline>LTC Properties ups qtly div to $0.365.</headline>
<dateline>OXNARD, Calif 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>LTC Properties Inc said increased the company's quarterly cash dividend to $0.365 per share on its outstanding common stock, representing an increase of $0.025 over the $0.34 per share paid in the previous quarter.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid on June 30,  to shareholders of record as of the close of business on June 15, 1997.  As a result of the increase, the annualized rate of distribution will be $1.46 per share.</p>
</text>
